@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+# Jenkins pipelines
+
+This site is how the estate writes its Jenkins pipelines. It holds the style guide that every
+Jenkinsfile follows, and the reference for JenkinsPipelineUtils, the shared library every pipeline
+loads. The navigation is the complete list of its pages.
+
+## Reading it as Markdown
+
+Every page is also published as Markdown, for agents and tools that read Markdown better than HTML:
+
+- [`llms.txt`](https://pipelines.home/docs/llms.txt) — an index of every page, linking each page's
+  Markdown copy.
+- [`llms-full.txt`](https://pipelines.home/docs/llms-full.txt) — every page's Markdown in one file.
