index 0000000..76c6b3f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/vars/containerTemplates.md
@@ -0,0 +1,41 @@
+# containerTemplates
+
+Sidecar containers for a scripted pipeline's pod. Each method returns a `containerTemplate` for
+`podTemplate(containers: [...])`, with the container named by the `name` argument. The container is
+kept alive by `sleep infinity` and its image is pulled on every build (`alwaysPullImage`).
+`container('<name>') { ... }` runs steps in it.
+
+Only a scripted `podTemplate` takes these. A declarative pipeline's `kubernetes` agent takes pod
+YAML, which [`podYaml`](podYaml.md) renders. The last column gives the `podYaml` argument that
+declares the same container. A container that `podYaml` names after its image runs under that name,
+unless the map entry gives a `name:`.
+
+| Call                         | Image and settings                                                                                 | Carries                                                                         | In `podYaml`                                                                                                                 |
+| ---------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
+| `helm(name)`                 | `alpine/helm:3.9.1`                                                                                | the Helm CLI                                                                    | `images: ['alpine/helm:3.9.1']`, as `helm`                                                                                   |
+| `k8s(name)`                  | `registry:5000/k8s:1.35.5`                                                                         | kubectl, crane                                                                  | `templates: ['k8s']`                                                                                                         |
+| `python(name)`               | `registry:5000/python`                                                                             | Python (slim)                                                                   | `images: ['registry:5000/python']`, as `python`                                                                              |
+| `aac_tools(name)`            | `registry:5000/aac-tools`                                                                          | the architecture-as-code tools (`gen-architecture`, `arch-validate`)            | `images: ['registry:5000/aac-tools']`, as `aac-tools`                                                                        |
+| `iac_toolchain(name)`        | `registry:5000/kube-coder-iac-toolchain`, uid 1000, `TF_PLUGIN_CACHE_DIR` empty                    | the image `cexec iac` runs in a KubeCoder environment: terraform, helm, kubectl, bao, step, promtool, python3 with poetry and uv, git | `images: [[image: 'registry:5000/kube-coder-iac-toolchain', runAsUser: 1000, env: [TF_PLUGIN_CACHE_DIR: '']]]`, as `kube-coder-iac-toolchain` |
+| `modern_app_toolchain(name)` | `registry:5000/kube-coder-modern-app-toolchain:node-24`, uid 1000                                  | KubeCoder's full-stack tool image: Node 24 with npm, pnpm and bun, poetry, ruff, uv, git | `templates: ['modern-app-toolchain']`                                                                                         |
+| `rsync(name)`                | `eeacms/rsync`                                                                                     | rsync                                                                           | none: kept only for `Firmware/KitchenDisplay`                                                                                |
+| `dockbuild(name, image)`     | `image`, with `BUILDER_UID`/`BUILDER_GID` 1000 and `BUILDER_USER`/`BUILDER_GROUP` `jenkins`      | a dockbuild or dockcross cross-compiler                                         | none: kept only for `Firmware/KitchenDisplay`                                                                                |
+
+## The toolchain containers run as uid 1000
+
+`iac_toolchain` and `modern_app_toolchain` run as uid 1000, the agent's own user. The checkout and
+whatever the container writes into the workspace then share an owner: git refuses a repository that
+another uid owns.
+
+`iac_toolchain` sets `TF_PLUGIN_CACHE_DIR` to the empty string. The image points it at a KubeCoder
+home overlay that an agent pod lacks, and terraform reports a missing cache directory as a CLI
+configuration error on every run. The empty value leaves the cache off. `modern_app_toolchain`'s
+image points `COREPACK_HOME` and `PNPM_HOME` at such overlays too; uid 1000 owns `/home/ubuntu` in
+the image, so corepack and pnpm create them there, empty on every build.
+
+## Kept only for `Firmware/KitchenDisplay`
+
+`rsync` and `dockbuild` have no other caller. The KitchenDisplay job is disabled, and this code goes,
+or is rebuilt, with ANS-93 (review report J10 and J20). `dockbuild` sets no command, so the image's
+own entrypoint runs, with `sleep infinity` as its arguments. A shell step that must run as the
+Jenkins user is prefixed with `gosu 1000:1000 `.
