+# Deploy-repo architecture producer
+
+A deploy repo's `Jenkinsfile.architecture`, run by the job `AaC/<App>Deploy`. It generates the
+architecture of one stage of the app from the repo's chart, validates it, and archives it as the
+producer's artifact. AaC/Architecture copies the artifact from the job's last successful build.
+
+## What is specific to this type
+
+- **Generate, then validate.** `Generate architecture` runs `gen-architecture --stage <stage>
+  --producer <id>` and archives the file it writes ([GRAN-3](../guide/stage-granularity.md#gran-3)).
+  `Validate architecture` is the gate. A model that fails validation was archived by a failed
+  build, and AaC/Architecture never copies it.
+- **One stage per file.** The file publishes one stage of the app, from the branch Argo CD syncs
+  it from. A second stage's producer is a file of its own, `Jenkinsfile.architecture-<stage>`
+  ([FILE-2](../guide/file-layout.md#file-2)).
+- **`checkout scm`**, like every other file ([CHK-1](../guide/checkout.md#chk-1)): the branch is
+  the job's, not written in the file.
+- **The `aac-tools` sidecar** and **the accepted helper** are as for the
+  [app architecture producer](app-architecture.md).
+
+## The reference file
+
+The `AaC/ChartsDeploy` job's `Jenkinsfile.architecture`:
+
+```groovy
+--8<-- "deploy-architecture.groovy"
+```
