+++ b/docs/pages/types/index.md
@@ -0,0 +1,30 @@
+# Pipeline types
+
+Every Jenkins job in the estate is of one of these types, and each type has a reference file: a
+complete Jenkinsfile, from one of the type's jobs, written to every rule of the
+[style guide](../guide/index.md). Every reference file passes the Jenkins controller's declarative
+linter. A new pipeline starts from its type's reference file.
+
+| Type | What the pipeline does | Reference file |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| [App architecture producer](app-architecture.md) | Validates an app repo's hand-authored architecture model and archives it. | AaC/Ginbov |
+| [Deploy-repo architecture producer](deploy-architecture.md) | Generates a deploy repo's architecture from its chart, then validates and archives it. | AaC/ChartsDeploy |
+| [Image build](image-build.md) | Builds an image with kaniko, then pins it into a deploy repo. | Ginbov; IaC/IaC Docker Image for a build that detects its changes |
+| [Artifact build](artifact-build.md) | Builds an artifact that another job uses, archives it, and starts that job. | ScanToPdf/ScanToPdfServer |
+| [ESP-IDF firmware](firmware.md) | Builds a device's firmware and uploads it over the air. | Firmware/PaperClock; Firmware/Intercom for several hardware versions |
+| [Validation Job](validation-job.md) | Runs the test suite as a Kubernetes Job, then builds, pushes and pins. | SSEGateway/SSEGateway |
+| [iac-controller job](iac-controller.md) | Runs `iac` calls on srviac: lint, apply, drift checks, scheduled rolls. | IaC/Scheduled Calico Rollout |
+| [Configuration apply](configuration-apply.md) | Lints and tests a configuration, then applies it to a live service. | YouTrack/YouTrackConfiguration |
+| [Promotion](promotion.md) | Started by hand: retags images and advances a deploy branch. | KubeCoder/Promote-PRD |
+| [Image matrix](image-matrix.md) | Builds a stage per image variant, generated at run time. | DockerImages |
+| [Architecture collector](architecture-collector.md) | Sets its triggers from a YAML list, collects every producer and builds the viewer. | AaC/Architecture |
+| [Scheduled snapshot producer](snapshot-producer.md) | Generates a producer's artifact from a live system, on a schedule. | AaC/Home Assistant Fleet |
+
+## Jobs without a type
+
+- **Firmware/KitchenDisplay** cross-builds a kiosk and deploys it over SSH. Its job is disabled and
+  its deploy path is gone, so it has no reference file. ANS-93 decides whether it is deleted or
